InputOverrideHandler no longer swaps the LocalPlayer's KeyboardInput for PlayerMovementInput (there is no client input on a server; the host
applies isInputForcedDown() itself). BlockBreakHelper drops the client-side destroy-delay reset, BlockPlaceHelper asks
isPassenger() instead of the LocalPlayer-only isHandsBusy().

